<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Send men whose eyes have seen the King!</l><l>Men in whose ears His sweet words ring;</l><l>Send such Thy lost ones home to bring;</l><l>Send them where Thou wilt come.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To bring good news to souls in sin;</l><l>The bruised and broken hearts to win;</l><l>In every place to bring them in,</l><l>Where Thou Thyself wilt come.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Gird each one with the Spirit’s sword,</l><l>The sword of Thine own deathless word;</l><l>And make them conquerors, conquering Lord,</l><l>Where Thou Thyself wilt come.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Raise up, O Lord the Holy Ghost,</l><l>From this broad land a mighty host,</l><l>Their war-cry, We will seek the lost,</l><l>Where Thou, O Christ, wilt come!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
